Oh, yeah!

153
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:07,420
Hey, old man!

154
00:09:07,680 --> 00:09:09,117
Can you get this to move?

155
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:11,200
You're the one who made it, right?

156
00:09:12,900 --> 00:09:14,477
I didn't make it.

157
00:09:14,560 --> 00:09:17,817
This is the legendary
iron giant that is said

158
