Do robot stuff!

168
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:48,800
Get up, boys! Shoot lasers! Let's go!

169
00:09:49,020 --> 00:09:51,196
That is an antique, you trogglingite!

170
00:09:52,580 --> 00:09:54,400
Quite a fascinating story.

171
00:09:54,620 --> 00:09:57,397
But tell me, why would the
Iron Giant attack Marie Joie?

172
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,540
A fine question!

173
00:10:01,580 --> 00:10:03,240
