our modern understanding of science.

214
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:33,708
By the way, I'm glad Luffy and the others
are all right, but who's that woman?

215
00:12:33,980 --> 00:12:37,300
That's Jewelry Bonnie. She's
a pirate. Wait a second.

216
00:12:37,540 --> 00:12:40,457
That's not the same little
girl we saved earlier, is it?

217
00:12:40,540 --> 00:12:41,370
Huh?

218
00:12:41,453 --> 00:12:44,162
I'm sorry, what is going
on with Vegapunk's head?

219
00:12:45,520 --> 00:12:47,540
Is Bonnie okay? What gives?

220
00:12:48,520 --> 00:12:49,380
Poor Bonnie.

221
00:12:49,760 --> 00:12:51,380
She's been through so much.

222
00:12:51,920 --> 00:12:53,017
Yeah, because of you.

223
00:12:53,100 --> 00:12:54,217
She should get to hit you.

224
00:12:54,300 --> 00:12:56,657
What the hell do you know about this, huh?

225
00:12:56,740 --> 00:12:57,760
That's a scene!

226
00:12:59,680 --> 00:13:04,420
When she wakes up, there's something
important I need to give her.

227
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:07,760
But first, I have a favor to ask.

228
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:11,737
It's extremely fortunate that
you showed up here when you did.

229
00:13:11,820 --> 00:13:13,467
You might even call it fate.

230
00:13:13,740 --> 00:13:14,740
What do you mean?

231
00:13:15,040 --> 00:13:17,393
I need you to take me away from Egghead.

232
00:13:17,940 --> 00:13:19,411
I need Quasar, your help!

233
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:20,750
Huh?

234
00:13:30,340 --> 00:13:32,080
This is Cipher Palace speaking.

235
00:13:32,560 --> 00:13:34,736
Grant us entry to the island at once.

236
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:36,120
Do you copy?

237
00:13:36,380 --> 00:13:37,537
I said this is Cipher Palace.

238
00:13:37,620 --> 00:13:38,450
Oh, no, no.

239
00:13:38,533 --> 00:13:39,363
This is bad.

240
00:13:39,446 --> 00:13:40,280
This is very bad!

241
00:13:41,580 --> 00:13:42,410
Attack!

242
00:13:53,020 --> 00:13:55,117
Should have trained their pets better.

243
00:13:55,200 --> 00:13:56,082
We're not cool!

244
00:13:57,900 --> 00:13:59,320
We received a report.

245
00:13:59,680 --> 00:14:02,417
It seems that Jewelry
Bonnie is here on Egghead.

246
00:14:02,500 --> 00:14:03,737
Well, that's convenient.

247
00:14:03,820 --> 00:14:05,820
Don't let her escape again. Go!

248
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:08,900
She's outlived her usefulness.

249
00:14:09,100 --> 00:14:11,020
Be sure to kill her on sight.

250
00:14:12,300 --> 00:14:14,820
Chaka, a government ship just arrived!

251
00:14:17,420 --> 00:14:18,440
What? Why?

252
00:14:18,900 --> 00:14:20,371
